        "## Counts Analysis\n",
        "\n",
        "The simplest analysis is the counts score. For each class, I calculate how often it was selected as best and how often it was selected as worst, relative to the number of times it was shown. The score is:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\text{score}_j = \\%\\text{best}_j - \\%\\text{worst}_j\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "A positive score means the class was more often chosen as best than worst. A negative score means the class was more often chosen as worst than best."
