      "source": [
        "## MNL via Maximum Likelihood\n",
        "\n",
        "The log-likelihood sums the probability of the observed best and worst choices across all tasks:\n",
        "\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\\ell(\\boldsymbol{\\beta}) = \\sum_{\\text{tasks}} \\left[\\beta_{j_b^*} - \\log \\sum_{j \\in \\text{shown}} \\exp(\\beta_j) - \\beta_{j_w^*} - \\log \\sum_{j \\in \\text{shown} \\setminus j_b^*} \\exp(-\\beta_j) \\right]\n",
        "$$\n",
        "\n",
        "I maximize this log-likelihood using numerical optimization."
      ],
      "id": "2c666a59"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "#| label: mle-fit\n",
        "\n",
        "mle = minimize(\n",
        "    neg_log_likelihood,\n",
        "    x0=np.zeros(K),\n",
        "    jac=neg_log_likelihood_grad,\n",
        "    method=\"BFGS\",\n",
        "    options={\"gtol\": 1e-6, \"maxiter\": 1000}\n",
        ")\n",
        "\n",
        "mle_success = mle.success\n",
        "mle_message = mle.message\n",
        "beta_mle_free = mle.x\n",
        "beta_mle = full_beta(beta_mle_free)\n",
        "\n",
        "# Approximate covariance matrix from the inverse Hessian returned by BFGS.\n",
        "# Item 1 is fixed, so its SE is 0 by construction.\n",
        "cov_free = np.asarray(mle.hess_inv)\n",
        "se_free = np.sqrt(np.diag(cov_free))\n",
        "se_mle = np.r_[0.0, se_free]\n",
        "\n",
        "shares_mle = np.exp(beta_mle) / np.exp(beta_mle).sum()\n",
        "\n",
        "mle_table = labels.copy()\n",
        "mle_table[\"beta_mle\"] = beta_mle\n",
        "mle_table[\"se_mle\"] = se_mle\n",
        "mle_table[\"mle_share\"] = shares_mle\n",
